## 10.3 — Global topic numbering

Introduce a global sequence across all 500 topics.

Examples:

- 001 / 500.
- 002 / 500.
- 003 / 500.
- Continue through 500 / 500.

Display this as a secondary navigation indicator where appropriate.

Readers must be able to understand both:

